WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.129
Sign in with the account that owns the website and open Settings.

00:00:05.129 --> 00:00:08.900
Review the account and selected site before changing anything.

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:17.281
Timezone changes affect how daily report periods are grouped; do not change the domain unless you control the replacement domain.

00:00:17.481 --> 00:00:23.247
Choose the API tab to create a scoped revenue key for a particular site.

00:00:23.247 --> 00:00:28.601
The secret is shown once, so save it in the website server environment.

00:00:28.601 --> 00:00:34.778
A rotated key immediately stops accepting the old one; update integrations at the same time.

00:00:34.978 --> 00:00:39.759
The More tab links to help, privacy, and billing information.

00:00:39.759 --> 00:00:44.062
Read retention and location notes before enabling optional collection.

00:00:44.062 --> 00:00:52.190
Settings are private to the signed-in owner; do not share screenshots that show account details or tokens.
